{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11108250","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11108250","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1110825001:1":{"text":"艾雅在上，没想到我们能这么快重获自由！","source_cn":"艾雅在上，没想到我们能这么快重获自由！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA108539396C12E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110825002:1":{"text":"……这里没有蛮血。","source_cn":"……这里没有蛮血。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13FE570712DDDF05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110825003:1":{"text":"他们人呢？","source_cn":"他们人呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x093F96E09ECD562B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110825004:1":{"text":"蛮血……和我们一起被抓来的蛮血，都被提前转运走了。","source_cn":"蛮血……和我们一起被抓来的蛮血，都被提前转运走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3952F15A2EB16B80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110825005:1":{"text":"流沙之爪说，蛮血反抗心强，体力和力量都比我们好，应该尽早送去“该去的地方”。","source_cn":"流沙之爪说，蛮血反抗心强，体力和力量都比我们好，应该尽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0DC2180EB4C63C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1110825005"